mes and used GRADE to assess certainty of evidence\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"After a systematic review of the literature, the Work Group defined critical outcomes and used GRADE to assess certainty of evidence rated on a scale of 1 (high certainty) to 4 (very low certainty).\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Given the similarities in the target population and the vaccine schedule used, a detailed safety assessment was performed combining data from three studies of healthy infants\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Noninferiority for the 13 shared serotypes with PCV13 requires the lower bound of the 2-sided 95% CI for IgG GMC ratio (V114/PCV13) to be >0.5\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"data_focus\", \"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}